commit dfb0f2ec702ce44127817508162e31fab0a123ba

C03: the reversed-mute check no longer reads the tail of «micrófono» as a negation (MIC1815)

MIC1813 measured: audio.microphone.mute completed and verified, but the composer vetoed the true Spanish draft «El micrófono está silenciado.» three times as reversed_mute, because its unmuted pattern «no esta silenci» matched inside «micrófono está silenciado». The negations now require a word boundary.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


